id: pm-web-mv7l
title: Review codeql-action v4.38.0 into the pinned-action allowlist so the Dependabot group can merge
description: "pm-web's workflow-security gate asserts every external action resolves to a commit listed in TRUSTED_ACTION_COMMITS, so a Dependabot bump of github/codeql-action fails CI by design until a human reviews the new commit. Dependabot PR #147 moves github/codeql-action/init and /analyze from cdf488f (v4.37.9) to b96794f (v4.38.0). Verified against the upstream repository: b96794f015dfd88f77b49b1c93e0fa7110f94c63 is the commit carrying the v4.38.0 and v4 tags in github/codeql-action, authored 2026-09-09, and cdf488f carries v4.37.9. Both sub-actions move as one release commit, which the companion gate also asserts."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-17T19:01:09.893Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-17T19:01:22.215Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-17T19:01:22.180Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-17T19:01:22.180Z"
claim_principal: claude-orchestrator
author: claude-orchestrator
acceptance_criteria: TRUSTED_ACTION_COMMITS lists b96794f for both codeql-action sub-actions; the reviewed commit is confirmed to carry the upstream v4.38.0 tag; test/workflow-security.test.ts passes all three assertions
resolution: codeql-action v4.38.0 reviewed and added to the pinned-action allowlist
expected_result: workflow-security gate passes with both codeql sub-actions on the v4.38.0 commit
actual_result: "3 of 3 assertions pass: action-pin gate, single-release CodeQL sub-actions, and the read-only checkout credential check"
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  test/workflow-security.test.ts,project,reviewed-commit allowlist
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  npx tsx --test test/workflow-security.test.ts,project,claude-orchestrator,"2026-09-17T19:01:20.225Z",local_mutation,dependabot/github_actions/codeql-action-03ad6eec6c
close_reason: "b96794f015dfd88f77b49b1c93e0fa7110f94c63 confirmed as the upstream v4.38.0/v4 tag commit in github/codeql-action; both sub-action entries updated; the gate previously failed CI on this branch with the stale cdf488f value, so the assertion is live rather than vacuous."
body: ""
